        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "执行次数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the same file (judged by content, regardless of name or location) was recognized with the same settings, the earlier result is reused. “Recognize Again” always reads afresh. The list and results are kept after quitting and are there next time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同一个文件（按内容判断，与文件名和位置无关）用同样的设置识别过，就直接复用上次的结果。“重新识别”总是重新读取。列表和识别结果在退出后保留，下次打开继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Image" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "图片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Image decoding runs truly in parallel. PaddleOCR inference still runs one image at a time (so multiple model copies don't fight over the CPU), but the next image's decoding no longer waits." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "图片解码会真正并行；PaddleOCR 的模型推理仍逐张进行（避免多份模型抢占同一颗 CPU），但下一张的解码不再等待。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Images go into an .assets folder named after the .md file and are referenced by relative path. When off, image positions keep only an empty placeholder" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "图片存入与 .md 文件同名的 .assets 文件夹，并以相对路径引用。关闭后，图片位置只保留空占位"
