            "value" : "一次"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once a file is recognized, it is written to the output folder in the format chosen under Text & Export, keeping the subfolder structure. Source files whose output already exists count as done and aren't recognized again. Without an output folder, results stay in the list only." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个文件识别完成后，按“文本与导出”里选择的格式写入输出文件夹，并保留子文件夹结构；输出文件已存在的源文件视为已处理，不会重复识别。不选输出文件夹时，结果只留在列表里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once downloaded, choose the language in the menu above." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下载后，在上面的菜单中选择该语言。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One address a line. Each is opened in turn and the steps are done on it. Leave empty to work wherever things are." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每行一个网址，依次打开，在每个网页上执行这些步骤。留空则在当前界面直接执行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One document" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一份文档"
