            "value" : "智能分层组件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Smart Layering, the default engine, uses layout analysis to find tables, formulas and columns, and close reading to read them. Without these, every page is read as plain lines of text." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "默认的“智能分层”引擎先用版面分析找出表格、公式和分栏，再交给仔细识别读取。没有这两项下载时，每一页都只会按普通文字行识别。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
