            "value" : "文本检测与识别"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text OCRFlow is unsure of, and tables or formulas it couldn't fully read, are listed here once files are recognized." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文件识别完成后，OCRFlow 没把握的文字，以及没能完整读出的表格和公式，会列在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text Recognition" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文字识别"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text in a native PDF is already exact, so using it directly is fastest and most accurate. Hidden OCR layers that other software added to scans are of unknown quality, so those pages are recognized again by default." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "原生 PDF 的文字本身就是准确的，直接取用最快也最准；扫描件上由其他软件生成的隐藏 OCR 文字层质量未知，默认会重新识别。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text inside images" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "图片中的文字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text on the same line reads left to right, whatever column it is in. Suits receipts and forms with labels and values side by side" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同一行上的文字从左到右读，不管在哪一栏。适合收据和左右对照填写的表格"
          }
        }
      }
