    },
    "The PDF text layer has no text here, so quick reading reads the image instead" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PDF 文字层在此区域没有文字，改用快速识别读取图像"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The built-in model reads Simplified and Traditional Chinese, English, Japanese and 46 Latin-script languages. Korean, Russian, Arabic, Thai, Greek and Devanagari need a model of their own." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "内置模型可识别简繁中文、英文、日文和 46 种拉丁字母语言。韩文、俄文、阿拉伯文、泰文、希腊文和天城文需要单独下载模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The built-in models read Chinese, English, Japanese and 46 more languages, offline." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "内置模型可离线识别简繁中文、英文、日文等 50 种语言。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The context must fit one block's visual tokens plus its output. The per-block output limit keeps one block from stalling the whole page." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上下文要装得下一块图像的视觉 token 加上它的输出；单块输出上限防止某一块卡住整页。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The control, wherever it is" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按名称找控件，不论它在哪"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The detection probability map is incomplete" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "检测概率图数据不足"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first stage of PaddleOCR-VL: splits the layout and decides the reading order. Required for the VL engine" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
