          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To follow and repeat your clicks, keys and scrolls, turn on OCRFlow in Privacy & Security → Accessibility. It only watches while you record or capture, and keeps only the steps of a recording, until you delete it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
