        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "改为采用这种读法"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses macOS's built-in translation on this Mac; nothing is uploaded. The first time you use a language, macOS asks to download it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用 macOS 内置翻译，在本机完成，不上传内容。首次使用某种语言时系统会提示下载语言包。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses macOS's built-in translation on this Mac; nothing is uploaded. Watched-folder results get a translated copy beside them" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用 macOS 内置的本机翻译，不上传任何内容。监视文件夹的结果旁会另存一份译文"
