        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "整页提示词"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With “Fix upside-down lines” on, lines below this confidence are not flipped. Model output clusters around 0.27 / 0.73" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启“纠正倒置的文字行”时，置信度低于此值的行不翻转。模型输出集中在 0.27 / 0.73 附近"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Workspace" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "工作台"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Workspace (⌘1) · Review (⌘2)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "工作台（⌘1）· 复核（⌘2）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writes only the recognized text, with no structure." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只写出识别到的文字，不带任何结构。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writes tables with recognized structure to an Excel workbook, one sheet per table, keeping merged cells merged and writing plain numbers as numbers. Table structure comes from close reading; tables quick reading read as text are not exported." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把识别出结构的表格写成 Excel 工作簿，每个表格一个工作表，合并单元格保持合并，纯数字写成数值。表格结构来自仔细识别，快速识别读成文字的表格不会导出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writes, page by page, each line's text, four-point coordinates and confidence, plus each layout region's type, reading order, position, which engine read it and why it needs review — for further processing by other programs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按页写出每一行的文字、四点坐标与置信度，以及版面区域的类别、阅读顺序、位置、由哪个引擎识别和待复核原因，供其他程序继续处理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yellow marks where the two readings differ · Click the other reading to use it instead · %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "标黄的是两种读法不同的地方 · 点按另一种读法即可改为采用它 · %@"
